om/hyperium/tonic/) it generates HTTP/2 enabled client.\r\n\r\nThen I saw this article https://grpc.io/blog/grpc-on-http2/ that states:\r\n\r\n> we\u2019ll look at how gRPC builds on HTTP/2\u2019s long-lived connections to create a performant, robust platform for inter-service communication. We will explore the relationship between gRPC and HTTP/2, how gRPC manages HTTP/2 connections, and how gRPC uses HTTP/2 to keep connections alive, healthy, and utilized.\r\n\r\nI was just curious to hear if it's supported and if I can take advantage of the generated HTTP/2 client.\r\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/959366402/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "elpiel", "id": 8925621, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg5MjU2MjE=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8925621?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/elpiel", "html_url": "https://github.com/elpiel", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/elpiel/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/elpiel/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/elpiel/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/elpiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/elpiel/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/elpiel/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/elpiel/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/elpiel/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/elpiel/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/959780094", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/